# Netboot serving from the live key itself. kldload-netboot-server ships in
# includes.chroot; without these two it has nothing to hand a PXE client and
# dies staging the iPXE images. Debian names the images package plain 'ipxe'
# (Fedora splits it as ipxe-bootimgs-x86). ~5 MB; the service is off by
# default, so nothing starts unless somebody enables it (2026-09-12).
dnsmasq
ipxe
